  "details": "Version: 2021.2.1p2:1093-97650d1767 and before the update.\nFirst time noticed it 2 weeks ago in the Fancy Cat world as a later joiner. Couldn't see the Video, but the game went up to 11GB of Memory used until i blue screened.\nNow working on my own world i bugged out the Video Player, it doesn't play any Video anymore but tries loading? and the Memory keeps going up until i would crash with a blue screen.\nNorixWolfeVideoPlayer is the prefab i used.\nI can at least confirm that the same happened to a friend during the same session in the Fancy Cat World",
